      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To write a Python script that integrates with an external provider for logging application events with a shared request or correlation identifier, I will use the AWS CloudWatch service. This service is a concrete external provider that offers logging capabilities. I will import the `boto3` library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, to interact with CloudWatch. The script will include a function to send log events to CloudWatch, ensuring that the provider is identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
